{
  "title": "SupplySide Global 2026 参展价值评估报告",
  "category": "展会评估",
  "date": "2026-10-13",
  "readTime": 10,
  "prevId": "pack-expo-international-2026-evaluation",
  "nextId": null,
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "一、决策摘要"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"data-card data-card--score\"><div style=\"font-size:48px;color:#d48806;\">77<span style=\"font-size:20px;\"> / 100</span></div><div class=\"section-label\">值得参加，但建议控制投入或先验证</div></div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "text": "综合评分77/100：值得参加，但宜控制投入，聚焦营养保健品条包与粉体客户开发。SupplySide Global侧重原料、配方、合同制造和产品开发，生产技术是供应链的一部分。SMK的条包和软袋制造业务、Ourvita的条包粉剂及elinpack的粉体包装演示，使仅一具备具体切入点；IMA、Syntegon、Romaco、Marchesini等同行也列入官方名录。主要扣分在于展会主线仍偏原料与配方，同业展示部分集中在胶囊、软糖、压片和包衣，与仅一核心包装形式重叠不均衡，金属听装和消费品整线信号也较弱。因此适合专业观展、客户约访或围绕营养粉与条包的适度展位，暂不宜按综合设备展规模重投入。"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>内容</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>展会名称</td><td>SupplySide Global 2026（原SupplySide West）</td></tr><tr><td>评估届次与时间</td><td>2026年10月26—30日；展厅开放10月28—30日</td></tr><tr><td>地点</td><td>美国拉斯维加斯，Mandalay Bay Convention Center</td></tr><tr><td>展会侧重</td><td>营养保健品、食品饮料的原料、配方、代工、产品开发与生产技术</td></tr><tr><td>仅一适配方向</td><td>营养粉、功能固体饮料、Stick条包、粉体包装和代工产线交流</td></tr><tr><td>参展定位</td><td>值得参加，宜控制投入并聚焦营养品客户</td></tr><tr><td>综合评分</td><td>77/100；结论：值得参加，但建议控制投入或先验证</td></tr><tr><td>判断置信度</td><td>中高</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>维度</th><th>得分</th><th>判断</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>区域入口价值</td><td>15/20</td><td>营养保健品制造供应链入口较强</td></tr><tr><td>业务与产品相关性</td><td>24/30</td><td>条包与粉体业务强，听装及完整消费品整线较弱</td></tr><tr><td>赛道展商信号</td><td>21/30</td><td>同行参与明确，但部分展示偏胶囊和制剂工艺</td></tr><tr><td>展会可信度与影响力</td><td>17/20</td><td>长期运营，规模与产业组织基础较强</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "最关键的正面证据"
    },
    {
      "type": "ol",
      "items": [
        "SMK明确提供粉剂制造，并拥有覆盖条包、软袋、桶罐、瓶装等形式的六条包装线；Ourvita展示条包粉剂产品。 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=151642&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[3]</a> <a href=\"https://www.ourvita.com/supplyside-global-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[4]</a>",
        "elinpack确认6733号展位与现场演示，其业务是食品和营养原料粉体包装。 <a href=\"https://www.elinpack.com/article/reliable-powder-packaging-for-food-nutritional-ingredients--elinpack-at-supplyside-global---booth--6.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[5]</a>",
        "官方名录列有IMA、Syntegon、Romaco、Marchesini以及CVC、Federal等设备企业，生产技术参与有具体企业支撑。 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/Exhibitors.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://www.syntegon.com/news/supplyside-global-nutraceutical-manufacturing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[6]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=153673&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=154190&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a> <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/supplyside-global\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[9]</a>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "主要扣分点"
    },
    {
      "type": "ul",
      "items": [
        "展会主线是原料、配方和制造服务，包装设备并非主体；目标客户开发需要按粉体、条包和制造主体筛选。",
        "同行到场不等于展示仅一重叠设备。Syntegon已公布的是胶囊及软糖方案，Federal优惠设备也偏胶囊、压片和包衣。",
        "elinpack演示偏原料大包装，SMK等以制造服务为主；完整金属听装和消费品包装整线展示较弱。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "参与建议"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "适合以营养粉、运动营养、功能固体饮料和Stick条包为主题专业观展或设置适度展位，重点约访有实际制造业务的代工厂与适配品牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "展示材料应围绕包装样品、营养粉应用案例与条包后道视频组织。若主推听装奶粉或大型交钥匙整线，本展应作为客户开发补充，而非主要设备展示平台。"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "二、评分明细"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "1. 区域入口价值：15/20"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>子项</th><th>得分</th><th>证据摘要</th><th>置信度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>区域代表性</td><td>4/4</td><td>美国营养保健品供应链大型平台，长期举办 <a href=\"https://www.supplysideglobal.com/attend/attendees/why-attend/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[1]</a> <a href=\"https://west.supplysideshow.com/content/dam/Informa/westsupplysideshow/en/2022/SSW22-ExpoPreview-Digital.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[12]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>仅一相关行业入口属性</td><td>4/4</td><td>食品、保健品及营养粉合同制造场景明确 <a href=\"https://www.supplysideglobal.com/attend/attendees/why-attend/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[1]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=151642&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[3]</a> <a href=\"https://www.ourvita.com/supplyside-global-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[4]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>本地适配产业覆盖</td><td>3/4</td><td>原料、配方、代工与部分包装技术覆盖充分 <a href=\"https://www.supplysideglobal.com/attend/attendees/why-attend/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[1]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/Exhibitors.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/07/02/3321490/0/en/supplyside-global-previews-october-2026-event-with-expansions-including-added-expo-hall-day.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[11]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>生产端场景明确度</td><td>2/4</td><td>设备参与明确，但原料与制造服务仍是主线 <a href=\"https://www.supplysideglobal.com/attend/attendees/why-attend/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[1]</a> <a href=\"https://www.elinpack.com/article/reliable-powder-packaging-for-food-nutritional-ingredients--elinpack-at-supplyside-global---booth--6.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[5]</a> <a href=\"https://www.syntegon.com/news/supplyside-global-nutraceutical-manufacturing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[6]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>同区域替代性</td><td>2/4</td><td>营养制造客户开发有专长，PACK EXPO设备场景更集中 <a href=\"https://www.supplysideglobal.com/attend/attendees/why-attend/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[1]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/Exhibitors.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a></td><td>中</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "其优势是营养产品制造供应链。品牌、原料、配方开发和代工厂在同一场景交流，SMK与Ourvita的产品和制造业务为仅一提供直接切入点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "扣分来自设备场景并非主导。即使原料与代工企业数量大，也应围绕真实的粉体和包装制造业务筛选，不能把整个供应链都视为设备客户。"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "2. 业务与产品相关性：24/30"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>子项</th><th>得分</th><th>证据摘要</th><th>置信度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>核心应用行业匹配</td><td>6/6</td><td>保健品、运动营养和功能食品有具体产品与制造证据 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=151642&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[3]</a> <a href=\"https://www.ourvita.com/supplyside-global-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[4]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>包装设备场景</td><td>4/6</td><td>粉体包装演示、灌装与后道设备分类有直接证据 <a href=\"https://www.elinpack.com/article/reliable-powder-packaging-for-food-nutritional-ingredients--elinpack-at-supplyside-global---booth--6.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[5]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=154190&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>Stick条包信号</td><td>6/6</td><td>Ourvita条包粉剂与SMK条包制造能力明确 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=151642&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[3]</a> <a href=\"https://www.ourvita.com/supplyside-global-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[4]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>听装／粉体信号</td><td>5/6</td><td>elinpack食品营养粉包装演示明确，以原料粉体为主 <a href=\"https://www.elinpack.com/article/reliable-powder-packaging-for-food-nutritional-ingredients--elinpack-at-supplyside-global---booth--6.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[5]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>软袋／整线信号</td><td>3/6</td><td>SMK有软袋制造业务，CVC有后道，完整消费品整线较弱 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=151642&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[3]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=154190&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a></td><td>中</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "条包和营养粉是最强匹配项：成品粉剂条包与粉体包装演示均已确认，说明相关性超过泛健康食品概念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "原料大袋包装与消费品条包、听装线不同；CVC的后道和SMK的软袋业务支撑部分延伸，但完整消费品整线及听装信号仍不突出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "3. 赛道展商信号：21/30"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>子项</th><th>得分</th><th>证据摘要</th><th>置信度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>区域同行／本地设备商信号</td><td>5/6</td><td>美国服务网络的IMA、Syntegon、CVC和Federal确认参与 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/Exhibitors.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://www.syntegon.com/news/supplyside-global-nutraceutical-manufacturing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[6]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=153673&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=154190&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a> <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/supplyside-global\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[9]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>全球同行信号</td><td>6/6</td><td>IMA、Syntegon、Romaco、Marchesini列入当届官方名录 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/Exhibitors.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>重叠产品展示证据</td><td>2/6</td><td>粉体包装演示直接相关；主要头部展示偏胶囊或工艺 <a href=\"https://www.elinpack.com/article/reliable-powder-packaging-for-food-nutritional-ingredients--elinpack-at-supplyside-global---booth--6.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[5]</a> <a href=\"https://www.syntegon.com/news/supplyside-global-nutraceutical-manufacturing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[6]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=153673&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a> <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/supplyside-global\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[9]</a></td><td>中</td></tr><tr><td>相关设备商数量</td><td>4/6</td><td>粉体、瓶装、工艺和配套设备企业有多家确认 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/Exhibitors.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://www.elinpack.com/article/reliable-powder-packaging-for-food-nutritional-ingredients--elinpack-at-supplyside-global---booth--6.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[5]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=154190&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[8]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>展商信息可验证性</td><td>4/6</td><td>名录与部分企业公告可核实，展品方向完整度不同 <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/Exhibitors.aspx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[2]</a> <a href=\"https://www.elinpack.com/article/reliable-powder-packaging-for-food-nutritional-ingredients--elinpack-at-supplyside-global---booth--6.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[5]</a> <a href=\"https://www.syntegon.com/news/supplyside-global-nutraceutical-manufacturing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[6]</a> <a href=\"https://exhibitor.supplysideglobal.com/supplysideglobal26/Public/eBooth.aspx?BoothID=153673&Nav=False\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[7]</a></td><td>中</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "本次确认多家清单内同行参展，因此全球同行信号较强。区域网络方面也有美国服务企业和本地设备供应商。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "重叠展示得分较低是因为具体内容有差异。Syntegon公开的胶囊与软糖方案属于营养制造端，但并不直接对应仅一Stick、粉剂听装和软袋；这也是总分没有进入重点设备展档位的原因。"
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "4. 展会可信度与影响力：17/20"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<table><thead><tr><th>子项</th><th>得分</th><th>证据摘要</th><th>置信度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>主办方可信度</td><td>4/4</td><td>Informa主办，长期运营营养产业活动 <a href=\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/07/02/3321490/0/en/supplyside-global-previews-october-2026-event-with-expansions-including-added-expo-hall-day.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[11]</a> <a href=\"https://www.supplysideglobal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[13]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>展会历史稳定性</td><td>4/4</td><td>1997年起举办，2022年官方纪念25周年 <a href=\"https://west.supplysideshow.com/content/dam/Informa/westsupplysideshow/en/2022/SSW22-ExpoPreview-Digital.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[12]</a></td><td>高</td></tr><tr><td>规模与趋势</td><td>3/4</td><td>官网20,000+参与者、1,600+展商；当届为展前口径 <a href=\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/07/02/3321490/0/en/supplyside-global-previews-october-2026-event-with-expansions-including-added-expo-hall-day.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[11]</a> <a href=\"https://www.supplysideglobal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[13]</a></td><td>中</td></tr><tr><td>认证与行业背书</td><td>3/4</td><td>营养产业组织、赞助与合同制造企业参与 <a href=\"https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/07/02/3321490/0/en/supplyside-global-previews-october-2026-event-with-expansions-including-added-expo-hall-day.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[11]</a> <a href=\"https://www.supplysideglobal.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[13]</a></td><td>中</td></tr><tr><td>媒体与口碑</td><td>3/4</td><td>多家制造和设备企业发布当届参展信息 <a href=\"https://www.ourvita.com/supplyside-global-2026/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[4]</a> <a href=\"https://www.elinpack.com/article/reliable-powder-packaging-for-food-nutritional-ingredients--elinpack-at-supplyside-global---booth--6.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[5]</a> <a href=\"https://www.syntegon.com/news/supplyside-global-nutraceutical-manufacturing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[6]</a> <a href=\"https://fedequip.com/trade-shows/supplyside-global\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">[9]</a></td><td>高</td></tr></tbody></table>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "长期运营历史、Informa组织和多家企业当届参与，支持展会稳定性。官网规模数据采用参与者和展商口径，不写成设备采购人数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "扣分主要在数据和行业口碑证据的细分程度。大型营养行业平台的影响力较强，但设备与整线的专门评价仍弱于专业包装设备展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "三、具体展商与业务切入"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
